{"title":"Specimen Cyprus Seniors Provincial/2nd grade/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Specimen_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial/2nd_grade/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/5/c350fcbae8eddc9e43c3beba8ed3da7933f9217c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\rho_{1}, \\rho_{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"40\" height=\"11\" /> are the roots of equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/e/98e5f7614c160535ad235368ae863ead8f54b24e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-x+1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"114\" height=\"16\" /> then:\n</p><p>a) Prove that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/5/375b4d3af7b372f77c92b3bc71a588fbc2335dfe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\rho_{1}^3=\\rho_{2}^3 = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"104\" height=\"19\" /> and\n</p><p>b) Calculate the value of: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/f/3ff221bbfeb070e32cbfd8d764643e7da28bbf8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\rho_{1}^{2006} + \\rho_{2}^{2006}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"94\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Specimen_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial/2nd_grade/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/0/8a0d53f6cb241f151001161d04c14a51a1bdbc02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\rho_1, \\rho_2 \\neq -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"88\" height=\"17\" />, we can multiply both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/c/cccb103143393c0119f5ab61d6d53a852ce70fcf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/5/c350fcbae8eddc9e43c3beba8ed3da7933f9217c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\rho_{1}, \\rho_{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"40\" height=\"11\" /> will still satisfy the equation: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/3/c1321588c2cd64df8f1bdb795a2bdbf76f0ea0b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x^2-x+1)(x+1)=(0)(x+1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"253\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/7/ff776a4b70fb311c1e45dfb6d392971c00052ad2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^3 + 1 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"82\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/3/3c3c592c8ee719bf3f3abf13ed8aa51e80951cd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^3 = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"64\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/5/375b4d3af7b372f77c92b3bc71a588fbc2335dfe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\rho_{1}^3=\\rho_{2}^3 = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"104\" height=\"19\" /> as desired <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/0/13017cf0d25d14fc45d517abf5080bee1c075c73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathbb{Q.E.D.}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"65\" height=\"26\" />. \n</p><p><br />\nThe third roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/0/9d04fb93ad7ebfbb431e1f5f6cf6154e7261b2d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1 = cis(180^\\circ)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"117\" height=\"18\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/2/e228e09ea8b220d65849daa7256808fb6e27d50f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$cis(60^\\circ)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/3/f4339d797519b847dc9431fdb7a031b9212760ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$cis(-60^\\circ)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"75\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />. \n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/0/8a0d53f6cb241f151001161d04c14a51a1bdbc02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\rho_1, \\rho_2 \\neq -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"88\" height=\"17\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/8/7085b80ef091a8bcdee5b2b03bd334484a545de7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\rho_{1} = cis(60^\\circ)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"102\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/0/b70827fb8f4e1fbd97458b85da9172a4a4df230d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\rho_{2} = cis(-60^\\circ)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"116\" height=\"18\" />. (Switching the two values will not affect the result). \n</p><p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/2/a52ae28f18422765c429c7afab5683288c095cfc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\rho_{1}^6=\\rho_{2}^6 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"93\" height=\"21\" />, and that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/f/6fff2278cae0e95d8160feac9f3ddfa82ee641c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2006 = 6(334)+2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"142\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/a/1da73e083b27e5efe6294cd1b02594202fb9b1eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\rho_{1}^{2006} + \\rho_{2}^{2006} = \\rho_{1}^{2} + \\rho_{2}^{2} = cis(120^\\circ) + cis(-120^\\circ) =$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"398\" height=\"19\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/2/362e9aa00795f066d3c1799edb429de383ede69c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(-\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}i \\right) + \\left(-\\frac{1}{2} - \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}i \\right) = \\boxed{-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"305\" height=\"53\" />\n</p>\n<hr />\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Specimen_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial/2nd_grade/Problem_3\" title=\"Specimen Cyprus Seniors Provincial/2nd grade/Problem 3\">Previous Problem</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Specimen_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial/2nd_grade\" title=\"Specimen Cyprus Seniors Provincial/2nd grade\">Back to Exam</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Specimen_Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial/2nd_grade/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial_competition\" title=\"Cyprus Seniors Provincial competition\">Cyprus Seniors Provincial competition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Cyprus Seniors Provincial Problems and Solutions\">Cyprus Seniors Provincial Problems and Solutions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competition_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competition resources\">Mathematics competition resources</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018110853\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.015 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.028 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 125/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4511/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.